{"page": {"publish": false, "i18n": {"es_AR": {"title": "Sobre Kay", "content": "<style>.template-page .page-header{display:none!important}.template-page section.user-content{padding:0!important}.template-page section.user-content>.container{max-width:none!important;width:100%!important;padding:0!important}.template-page section.user-content .row{margin:0!important}.template-page section.user-content .col-md-8{flex:0 0 100%!important;max-width:100%!important;width:100%!important;padding:0!important}.kay-cover{position:absolute!important;top:0!important;left:0!important;width:100%!important;height:100%!important;max-width:none!important;object-fit:cover!important}</style>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wdth,wght@125,700;125,800&family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;1,9..144,400&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<div style=\"width: 100%; background: #F7F3E8; color: #124072; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6\">\n<section aria-label=\"Sobre Kay\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: stretch\">\n    <div style=\"flex: 1 1 480px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; padding: 64px clamp(20px, 6vw, 88px); box-sizing: border-box\">\n      <h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 64px; line-height: 1; color: #124072\">Sobre Kay</h1>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 440px\">En 2017 buscábamos algo que no había en el mercado: un <span style=\"font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 21px\">auténtico</span> yogur griego. Así nació Kay.</p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 440px\">Hace más de 8 años nos dedicamos a elaborar yogur griego de verdad, sin letra chica. Y la historia no termina acá.</p>\n      <a href=\"https://www.tiendakay.com.ar/100-elaborado-kay/\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin-top: 4px; background: #000000; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 18px; padding: 14px 24px; border-radius: 4px\">Conocé nuestros productos</a>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"flex: 1 1 480px; min-width: 0; position: relative; min-height: 520px; overflow: hidden\">\n      <img class=\"kay-cover\" src=\"https://kay-tiendanube-mcp-production.up.railway.app/assets/sobre-kay/kay-bowl.jpg\" alt=\"Bowl de yogur griego Kay con banana, arándanos y granola\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block\">\n      <img src=\"https://kay-tiendanube-mcp-production.up.railway.app/assets/sobre-kay/sticker-bien-hecho.png\" alt=\"Yogur griego bien hecho\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 24px; bottom: 28px; width: 210px; height: auto; display: block; transform: rotate(-6deg)\">\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding: 56px 16px 0; background: #F7F3E8\">\n    <div style=\"max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; background: #124072; color: #F7F3E8; border-radius: clamp(32px, 9vw, 160px); padding: 64px clamp(28px, 8vw, 120px); box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 40px 64px; transform: rotate(-1.2deg); box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -24px #12407280\">\n      <p style=\"flex: 1.4 1 420px; min-width: 0; margin: 0; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 42px; line-height: 1.15; color: #F7F3E8\">Creemos en los alimentos reales, hechos con tiempo, cuidado y <span style=\"font-style: italic\">dedicación</span>.</p>\n      <div style=\"flex: 1 1 280px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-left: 1px solid #F7F3E866; padding-left: 32px\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F7F3E833\">\n          <span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-stretch: 125%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">01</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 18px\">Ingredientes claros</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F7F3E833\">\n          <span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-stretch: 125%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">02</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 18px\">Sin tomar atajos</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 0\">\n          <span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-stretch: 125%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">03</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 18px\">Nada que esconder</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding: 64px 16px; background: #F7F3E8\">\n    <div style=\"max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: stretch; gap: 40px\">\n      <div style=\"flex: 1 1 380px; min-width: 0; min-height: 460px; position: relative; overflow: hidden\">\n        <img class=\"kay-cover\" src=\"https://kay-tiendanube-mcp-production.up.railway.app/assets/sobre-kay/kay-cuchara.jpg\" alt=\"Pote de yogur griego Kay abierto con una cucharada\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; border-radius: 4px\">\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex: 1.2 1 480px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 26px\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-stretch: 125%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase\">Así lo elaboramos</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 17px; max-width: 520px\">Filtramos el yogur griego 12 horas en bolsas de tela hechas a mano y medimos el pH lote por lote. Todo artesanal, del envase a la etiqueta.</p>\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px\">\n          <div style=\"background: #124072; color: #F7F3E8; border-radius: 4px; padding: 22px 22px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\">\n            <span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-stretch: 125%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1\">4 l</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">de leche por kilo</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 4px; padding: 22px 22px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\">\n            <span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-stretch: 125%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1\">15 h</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">de elaboración</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 4px; padding: 22px 22px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\">\n            <span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-stretch: 125%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1\">12 g</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">de proteína cada 100 g</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"background: #124072; color: #F7F3E8; border-radius: 4px; padding: 22px 22px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\">\n            <span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-stretch: 125%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1\">0 g</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">de azúcar agregada</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"cottage-title\" style=\"padding: 72px 16px; background: #F7F3E8; border-top: 1px solid #1240721A\">\n    <div style=\"max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 40px\">\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 12px; text-align: center; max-width: 640px\">\n        <h2 id=\"cottage-title\" style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-stretch: 125%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase\">Con la misma intención</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px\">La historia no termina en el yogur griego. Así elaboramos nuestro <span style=\"font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 20px\">queso cottage</span>.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 32px 48px\">\n        <div style=\"flex: 1 1 260px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 36px\">\n          <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px\">\n            <span style=\"background: #6B6B2A; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 4px\">Ingredientes justos</span>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\">Leche descremada, crema de leche, fermento láctico, cuajo y cloruro de sodio.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px\">\n            <span style=\"background: #6B6B2A; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 4px\">Alimento real</span>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\">Sin conservantes ni espesantes, respetando el proceso de elaboración tradicional.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <img src=\"https://kay-tiendanube-mcp-production.up.railway.app/assets/sobre-kay/cottage-pote.jpg\" alt=\"Pote de queso cottage tradicional Kay\" style=\"flex: 0 1 300px; width: 300px; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\">\n        <div style=\"flex: 1 1 260px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 36px\">\n          <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px\">\n            <span style=\"background: #6B6B2A; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 4px\">Aporte proteico</span>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\">6,5 g de proteína por porción de 50 g (2 cucharadas).</p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px\">\n            <span style=\"background: #6B6B2A; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 4px\">Textura granulada</span>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\">Se fermenta y se coagula. Así nacen sus gránulos suaves, de distintos tamaños.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"https://www.tiendakay.com.ar/queso-cottage1/\" style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase\">Conocé el queso cottage</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding: 64px 16px; background: #FFFFFF\">\n    <div style=\"max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px\">\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 12px\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-stretch: 125%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase\">Hechos por nosotros</h2>\n        <a href=\"https://www.tiendakay.com.ar/yogures/\" style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">Ver todos</a>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 16px\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.tiendakay.com.ar/yogures/griegos/\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-decoration: none; color: #124072; background: #F7F3E8; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden\">\n          <img src=\"https://acdn-us.mitiendanube.com/stores/950/583/products/01_yogur_griego_750g_1080x1080-09ed0366494b28e1d017823130054056-1024-1024.jpg\" alt=\"Yogur griego Kay 750 g\" style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; object-fit: cover; display: block\">\n          <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 16px 18px\">\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n              <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700\">Yogur Griego</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">170 g, 400 g, 500 g y 750 g</span>\n            </div>\n            <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#124072\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M13 6l6 6-6 6\"></path></svg>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.tiendakay.com.ar/yogures/queso-cottage/\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-decoration: none; color: #124072; background: #F7F3E8; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden\">\n          <img src=\"https://acdn-us.mitiendanube.com/stores/950/583/products/kay-cottage-400g-e508344f6c402c41af17837236493239-1024-1024.png\" alt=\"Queso cottage Kay 400 g\" style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; object-fit: cover; display: block\">\n          <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 16px 18px\">\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n              <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700\">Queso Cottage</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">250 g y 400 g</span>\n            </div>\n            <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#124072\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M13 6l6 6-6 6\"></path></svg>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.tiendakay.com.ar/yogures/bebibles/\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-decoration: none; color: #124072; background: #F7F3E8; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden\">\n          <img src=\"https://acdn-us.mitiendanube.com/stores/950/583/products/05_yogur_bebible_frutilla_1080x1080-ab0cf64201d3daad4e17823117766964-1024-1024.jpg\" alt=\"Yogur bebible Kay sabor frutilla\" style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; object-fit: cover; display: block\">\n          <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 16px 18px\">\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n              <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700\">Yogur Bebible</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Natural, frutilla y frutos rojos</span>\n            </div>\n            <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#124072\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M13 6l6 6-6 6\"></path></svg>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: stretch; background: #F3EFE4\">\n    <div style=\"flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; min-height: 440px; position: relative; overflow: hidden\">\n      <img class=\"kay-cover\" src=\"https://kay-tiendanube-mcp-production.up.railway.app/assets/sobre-kay/kay-textura.jpg\" alt=\"Textura cremosa del yogur griego Kay con el sello Yogur Griego natural\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; padding: 56px clamp(20px, 6vw, 88px); box-sizing: border-box\">\n      <h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-stretch: 125%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; max-width: 460px\">Para los que buscan algo más.</h2>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 17px; max-width: 400px\">Alimentos reales, sin letra chica. Sin conservantes, espesantes ni azúcar agregada.</p>\n      <a href=\"https://www.tiendakay.com.ar/100-elaborado-kay/\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin-top: 4px; background: #000000; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 18px; padding: 14px 24px; border-radius: 4px\">Probalo</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n"}}}}